# Dump Cargo Overboard (ORDERS menu). Fixture: the French Merchantman (id 2) at sea (47,29) is selected with
# three goods holds (50 Lumber, 100 Tools, 30 Furs); Caravel A (id 84) at sea (48,24) carries two passengers, no goods.
click 88 3                 # ORDERS menu
click 100 141              # "Dump Cargo Overboard": @OVERBOARD hold picker (one row per hold + Nothing)
click 102 161              # Nothing: the cargo stays
click 88 3
click 100 141
click 102 137              # 100 Tools: the middle hold goes, the others close ranks
click 88 3
click 100 141
click 102 132              # 50 Lumber
click 88 3
click 100 141
click 102 138              # 30 Furs: the holds are empty
click 88 3                 # Dump Cargo Overboard is greyed out now
shot
click 100 141              # clicking the greyed row does nothing, the menu closes
shot
key w                      # wait for next unit: Caravel A at (48,24), passengers only
wait 30
click 88 3                 # Dump is greyed here too
shot
click 100 141
shot
wait 5
